<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="Ab Tutorial"/>
    <meta name="description" content="learning coding from the basic and become a full stack developer"/>
    <meta property="og:title" content="Ab Tutorial"/>   
    <meta property="og:type" content="website"/>
    <meta property="og:image" content="https://i.postimg.cc/8krnzLxt/inbound7399747716248096388.png"/>
    <meta property="og:url" content="https://abrahambsirleaf.github.io/ab-tutorial/"/>   
      
      <style>
      *{
        margin: 0;
        padding: 0;
        box-sizing: border-box;
       }

   html {
     scroll-behavior: smooth;
   }
     
          
    body {
      height: 90vh;


      }
      #header {
       width: 100%;
       height: 40vh;
       display: flex;
       justify-content: center;
       text-align: center;
       background-image: url(https://i.postimg.cc/q7LjWLhj/inbound7419550753780704266.jpg);
       background-repeat: no-repeat;
       background-position: center;
       position: sticky;
       background-size: cover;
       background-attachment: fixed;
       color:red;
                  }

 
      }

      .header-content {
        font-size: 30px;
        }
        
      .
      p {
        font-size: 17px;
        }
        
       
      nav {
        margin-bottom: 10px;  
        padding: 6px;
        display: flex;
           
  
              }
        
        nav a{
          color: blue;
          text-decoration: none;
          font-size: 15px;
          }
      nav p{
        width:100%;      
        margin: 3px;
        border: none;
        background: white;   
        border-radius: 10px;
        padding: 5px; 
        color: blue;
        }
      #HTML {
        width: 100%;  
        height: 270vh;
        display: flex;
        justify-content: center;
        text-align: center;
        background-color: white; 
        color: white;
        font-size: 27px; 
        }

      .main {
        padding: 30px;
        height: 60vh;
        }
      .card {
        width: 100%;
        height: 28vh;
        display: flex;
        justify-content: center;
        align-items: center;
        background-color: midnightblue;
        padding:10px;
        color: white;      
        border-radius: 15px; 
        border-shadow:0 30px 20px rgba(44,0,0,0.6);
        margin: 9px;
        font-size:20px;
        }

      #printbutton {
          position: absolute;
          justify-content: left;
          }

      </style>
  </head>
  <body>
<header id="header">
  <section id="headersection">
    <div class="header-content">  
      <img src="https://i.postimg.cc/8krnzLxt/inbound7399747716248096388.png" alt="AB Logo" width="300" height="300">
    <h1 style="font-size:50px; color: Yellow; Text-border:>
      
  <h1 style="color: ; font-size: 40px;">AB CODING TUTORIAL</h1>
    <p>Tutorial by Abraham B Sirleaf</p>
      <hr>
      <br>
       
      <nav>
      <p><a href="#HTML">HTML</a></p>
      <p><a href="#aboutus">CSS</a></p>
      <p><a href="#History">JAVASCRIPT</a></p>
        <p>abrahambsirleaf1@gmail.com</p>
      </nav>
    </div>
    
  </section>
</header>  
    <br><br>
    <section id="HTML">
      <div class="main">
        <h2 style="color: midnightblue;">Welcome to HTML Tutorial</h2><br>
        <hr>
        <section>
        <div class="card">
        <h4 style="color: white;"><strong>LESSON 1: WHAT IS HTML</strong></h4>
          <hr>
        <br> <br>
<p>HTML = The language that builds structure of website</p>
        <br>
        </div>
        </section>
        
          <hr>
      <section>
  <div class="card">
<h4 style="color: white;">LESSON 2: BASIC STRUCTURE </h4><br>
    <hr>
<p>
  &lt;!DOCTYPE html&gt;<br>
&lt;html&gt;<br>
&lt;head&gt;<br>
  &lt;title&gt;My Website&lt;/title&gt;<br>
&lt;/head&gt;<br>
&lt;body&gt;
  All visible content goes here
&lt;/body&gt;<br>
&lt;/html&gt;
</p>
        </div>
      </section>
  <section>
    <div class="card">
<h4 style="color: white;">LESSON 3: HEADINGS</h4><br>
&lt;h1&gt;Biggest Heading&lt;/h1&gt;<br>
&lt;h2&gt;Second Heading&lt;/h2&gt;<br>
&lt;h3&gt;Third Heading&lt;/h3&gt;<br>
&lt;h4&gt;Small Heading&lt;/h4&gt;<br>
&lt;h5&gt;Smaller&lt;/h5&gt;<br>
&lt;h6&gt;Smallest&lt;/h6&gt;<br><br>
    </div>
  </section>
        <section>
          <div class="card">
<h4 style="color: white;"">LESSON 4: PARAGRAPH </h4><br>
&lt;p&gt;This is paragraph&lt;/p&gt;<br>
&lt;p&gt;Second paragraph&lt;/p&gt;<br><br>
<hr>
          </div>
        </section>
  <section>
    <div class="card">
<h4 style="color: white;">LESSON 5: LINE BREAK AND HORIZONTAL LINE</h4>
&lt;br&gt; = break line <br>
&lt;hr&gt; = horizontal line
Example:
&lt;p&gt;First line&lt;br&gt;Second line&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
    </div>
  </section>
        
<section>
  <div class="card">
<h4 style="color: white;">LESSON 6: LINKS - NAVIGATION</h4>
&lt;a href="https://google.com"&gt;Go to Google&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;a href="#about"&gt;Go to About Section&lt;/a&gt;
  </div>
</section>
    
LESSON 7: IMAGES
&lt;img src="logo.jpg" alt="My Logo"&gt;
&lt;img src="https://example.com/photo.jpg" alt="Photo"&gt;

LESSON 8: LISTS
Unordered List:
&lt;ul&gt;
  &lt;li&gt;Rice&lt;/li&gt;
  &lt;li&gt;Beans&lt;/li&gt;
  &lt;li&gt;Fish&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

Ordered List:
&lt;ol&gt;
  &lt;li&gt;First&lt;/li&gt;
  &lt;li&gt;Second&lt;/li&gt;
  &lt;li&gt;Third&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;

LESSON 9: DIV, SECTION, NAV, HEADER, FOOTER
&lt;header id="header"&gt;
  &lt;nav&gt;
    &lt;a href="#home"&gt;Home&lt;/a&gt;
    &lt;a href="#about"&gt;About&lt;/a&gt;
  &lt;/nav&gt;
&lt;/header&gt;

&lt;section id="home"&gt;
  &lt;div class="box"&gt;
    &lt;h1&gt;Home Content&lt;/h1&gt;
  &lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/section&gt;

&lt;footer&gt;
  &lt;p&gt;Copyright 2026&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/footer&gt;

LESSON 10: ID vs CLASS
ID = Unique, use # in CSS, one per page
&lt;div id="header"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

CLASS = Group, use . in CSS, many per page
&lt;div class="box"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="box"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

LESSON 11: FORM
&lt;form&gt;
  &lt;input type="text" placeholder="Enter name"&gt;
  &lt;input type="email" placeholder="Enter email"&gt;
  &lt;input type="password" placeholder="Password"&gt;
  &lt;button type="submit"&gt;Submit&lt;/button&gt;
&lt;/form&gt;

LESSON 12: TABLE
&lt;table border="1"&gt;
  &lt;tr&gt;
    &lt;th&gt;Name&lt;/th&gt;
    &lt;th&gt;Age&lt;/th&gt;
  &lt;/tr&gt;
  &lt;tr&gt;
    &lt;td&gt;John&lt;/td&gt;
    &lt;td&gt;20&lt;/td&gt;
  &lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;

LESSON 13: COMPLETE EXAMPLE
&lt;!DOCTYPE html&gt;
&lt;html&gt;
&lt;head&gt;
  &lt;title&gt;Hold Fast Ministry&lt;/title&gt;
&lt;/head&gt;
&lt;body&gt;
  &lt;header&gt;
    &lt;h1&gt;Hold Fast Ministry&lt;/h1&gt;
    &lt;nav&gt;
      &lt;a href="#home"&gt;Home&lt;/a&gt;
      &lt;a href="#about"&gt;About&lt;/a&gt;
    &lt;/nav&gt;
  &lt;/header&gt;
  &lt;section id="home"&gt;
    &lt;h2&gt;Welcome&lt;/h2&gt;
    &lt;p&gt;Welcome
        
      </div>
    </section>
    <script>
      alert ("Welcome to Ab website ");

    </script>
  </body>
</html>